<title>AUSTRALIA: Ausdoc nine-month net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Ausdoc nine-month net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended March 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   8.48 vs  6.26</p>
<p>    Net profit before abnormals    5.41 vs  4.25</p>
<p>    Sales				 78.74 vs 78.70</p>
<p>    Abnormal			loss 0.99 vs profit 0.05</p>
<p>    Extraordinary	    profit 13.91 vs loss 3.30</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Ausdoc Group Ltd is a business services group.</p>
<p>Ausdoc said the extraordinary profit reflected the sale of the Office Products division.  </p>
<p>It said the abnormal loss reflected the costs of the defence from a hostile takeover offer from Brambles Industries Ltd earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
